   "answer": "The agent follows a three-phase optimization pattern: (i) broad architectural exploration, (ii) focused hyperparameter refinement, and (iii) diminishing-returns finetuning [4:33]. For IMG-100, BN recomputation yielded a +0.47% gain (83.47%→83.94%) [4:36]. Learning-rate and warmdown changes required co-tuning: reducing batch size from 218 to 217 needed simultaneous learning rate adjustment (0.04→0.027) and warmdown schedule change (0.6715→0.702) [4:36]."
